maxcode --worktree login: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `maxcode fork`, `maxcode exec`, and `maxcode exec fork`
maxcode fork --worktree: `maxcode fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
maxcode fork --worktree --last: `maxcode fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
maxcode exec resume --worktree session: `--worktree` cannot resume an existing session; use `maxcode exec fork --worktree`
